title: HaroldAudenDungeon
---
Harold Auden: Harold feels uneasy as he steps into the room. He looks down at his feet to find them soaking in a  pool of blood. He jumps away, putting him face-to-face with the contents of one of the cells.
->It’s an old man sulking in the corner.
    <<neutral "Harold Auden">>
	Confused, he bangs on the bars of the cell. The figure looks up, makes brief eye contact with Harold, and then fades into air. 
->It’s a mound of flesh.
    <<add_fear "Harold Auden">>
    <<discover_fear "Harold Auden" 7>>
    <<terrified "Harold Auden">>
    //Fear of the Inhuman
    Something about this scene feels familiar to him. The mound of flesh begins to move to reveal two eyes staring at him, hanging off long nerves. He screams but can’t take his eyes off of it as it fades into air.  
->Nothing is there.
    <<neutral "Harold Auden">>
	“Huh. I could’ve sworn I saw something.” He continues on. 
->It’s a rabid dog.
    <<neutral "Harold Auden">>
	“Hi, doggy.” Harold is comforted by the bars that separate him from the mutt. The dog snarls before fading into air.  
===

title: HaroldAudenDiningRoom
